{{!--
    The context bar while something is placed on the Surface map from a list: a homeland, from
    Peoples and realms' Homelands (S0 step 4c-2, board C10), or an event's place, from the Ages and
    events page's inspector, which gives way to the map meanwhile (step 4c-1). Done, Escape or the
    click that places it ends it (and brings the page back).
--}}
<div class="fwmb-contents fwmb-bar-world">
    <span class="fwmb-bar-world-map"><span class="fwmb-icon fwmb-icon--place" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{worldPick.label}} <b>{{worldPick.name}}</b></span>
    <span class="fwmb-bar-world-hint">{{worldPick.hint}}</span>
    <button type="button" class="fwmb-btn fwmb-bar-world-done" data-action="stopWorldPick">{{localize "FILRODENSWMB.UI.Done"}}</button>
</div>
